# probe (quest rework P8): npcstatus <Npc> <normal|disappear>, a GM's GetNPCByID(id):setStatus(xi.status.<STATUS>).
# Promotion: Superior Private (ahtUrhgan 91, still Lua): Wajaom Woodlands' Warhorse_Hoofprint gives the Dark Rider
# Hoofprint (quest:keyItem) while the quest is accepted and the key item not held. The Hoofprints load hidden (npcs.yaml
# gives them no status; globals/dark_rider.lua shows them after a Dark Rider run), and the engine answers a trigger on a
# hidden NPC with a release only. Hidden: nothing. Shown (normal): the key item. Hidden again (disappear): nothing.
lists WajaomWoodlands/Warhorse_Hoofprint/onTrigger
char zone=WajaomWoodlands pos=-619.539,-10.483,-69.223 job=WAR lvl=1
quest AhtUrhgan.PromotionSuperiorPrivate accepted
charvar AssaultPromotion 25
login
trigger Warhorse_Hoofprint              # hidden: a release only, no handler
npcstatus Warhorse_Hoofprint normal     # a GM: shown
trigger Warhorse_Hoofprint              # accepted, no hoofprint: the Dark Rider Hoofprint (KEYITEM_OBTAINED)
finish-if-event
delkeyitem DarkRiderHoofprint           # a GM
npcstatus Warhorse_Hoofprint disappear  # a GM: hidden again
trigger Warhorse_Hoofprint              # hidden: a release only
